OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer charged with child
OL,4,Asex offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving police officer has been
OL,7,Fcharged with child sex offences.
OL,9,FHaydyn Brunsdon, a PC with Durham
OL,10,FPolice, faces two counts of sexual
OL,11,Fcommunication with a child.
OL,13,FThe force said he was arrested on
OL,14,FFriday and suspended from duty pending
OL,15,Fa criminal investigation.
OL,17,FThe 31-year-old appeared before
OL,18,FTeesside magistrates on Saturday and
OL,19,Fwas released on condition bail. He will
OL,20,Fnext appear at Newton Aycliffe
OL,21,FMagistrates' Court on 1 October.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
